mented, must keep the query scoped/read-only and behind the existing `snowball.read` capability, not open a new unscoped surface.</result>\\n<usage><subagent_tokens>152770</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>64</tool_uses><duration_ms>240481</duration_ms></usage>\\n</task-***>\"}\r\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
